{{Quote|Grants light-speed movement and powerful light-based attacks.|Shop}}
'''Light''' is a {{Rare}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|650,000}} or {{Robux|1,100}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Light allows the user to create, become and manipulate light itself to inflict damage to enemies; it also allows the user to fly at the speed of light, conjure a light spear, and use fast kicks & ranged rays to damage opponents.

==Awakening==
Light costs {{Fragment|14,500}} to fully [[Raids|awaken]]. 

The [[Titles|title]] "{{Title|The First Light}}" #037 will be granted upon awakening the first move of the Light Fruit. 

