==Overview==
<tabber> 
Unawakened=
{{#tag:tabber|Pros=
{{Overview|Pros|type=Unawakened
|'''General'''
* Long-ranged attacks, which gives it a versatile moveset.
* Low mastery requirements.
* Easy to obtain.
* Good for traveling as it is extremely fast.
* Excellent for starter players.

|'''[Z] Light Ray'''
* Decent damage.
* Good range.
* Little to no startup

|'''[X] Barrage of Light'''
* Slight stun.
* Teleports the user upwards, which is good for dodging attacks.

|'''[C] Reflection Kick'''
* Good [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Good damage.

|'''[V] Sky Beam Barrage'''
* [[Instinct/Break|Breaks instinct]].

|'''[F] Light Flight'''
* One of the fastest flights in the game.
}}

{{!}}-{{!}}Cons=
{{Overview|Cons|type=Unawakened
|'''General'''
* High knockback.
* Not good for boss fights in open spaces.

|'''[Z] Light Ray'''
* Difficult to aim on the air.
* High and unpredictable knockback.

|'''[X] Barrage of Light'''
* Deals a very low amount of damage if laggy since projectiles bug out.
* Difficult to hit on air.
* Poor accuracy.
*Projectiles are not guaranteed to hit

|'''[C] Reflection Kick'''
* High knockback, making it hard to grind with.
* Easy to predict, as there is slight start-up, and easily able to avoid with flash step

|'''[V] Sky Beam Barrage'''
* Close range.
* Does not work on [[water]].

|'''[F] Light Flight'''
* The lower the [[health]], the slower it will be.
* The user cannot change direction whilst flying.
}}
}}

|-|Awakened=
{{#tag:tabber|Pros=
{{Overview|Pros|type=Awakened
|'''General'''
* All moves deal high damage
* Amazing combo potential.
* All moves have low endlag.
* Good for PvP against fruits with big hitbox, especially [[Buddha]].

|'''[Z] Divine Arrow'''
* Good [[AoE]].
* Low cooldown.
* Doesn't knockback.
* Does nearly double the damage if held for all three arrows.

|'''[X] Hand of the Emperor'''
* Hard to dodge.
* Makes hit enemies less mobile.
* Specialized in short/medium range.

|'''[C] Lightspeed Destroyer'''
* Fast cooldown.
* Slight auto-aim.

|'''[V] Wrath of God'''
* Large [[AoE]].
* High damage.

|'''[F] Shining Flight'''
* Can control the direction.
* Second fastest flight in the game.
}}

{{!}}-{{!}}Cons=
{{Overview|Cons|type=Awakened
|'''General'''
* Very punishing if skills are missed
* Requires good aim

|'''[Z] Divine Arrow'''
* Difficult to hit all three projectiles in [[PvP]] unless the target is stunned.

|'''[X] Hand of the Emperor'''
* This move has end-lag (when moving the yellow beam), which puts the player at a disadvantage in combat if the move is missed.
* Quite hard to hit without stun.
* Creates vulnerability as the player is immobile.

|'''[C] Lightspeed Destroyer'''
* Single-target move which makes it unsuitable for PvE.
* Small hitbox.
* Will not deal ground smash damage if used high in the air.
* Hard to hit from far in PvP.
* Lacks the afterstun to work as a combo extender.

|'''[V] Wrath of God'''
* Unreliable damage.

|'''[F] Shining Flight'''
* The lower the [[health]], the slower it will be.
* Can only turn in perfect 45° angles, which makes it snappy when compared to other flight moves.
}}
}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==   
* Up until [[Updates/6|Update 6]], Light's sword (which is now a spear) used to be a separate hotbar item instead of being usable through the fruit.
** This spear can harm [[Blade]] users, as it counts as Fruit damage, not sword damage.
* Before [[Updates/24|Update 24]], Light had the fastest flight move in the game. 

